Formatter (working title) is a SaaS webapp enabling users to upload various file types (pdf, docx, txt, md, html, csv, etc.) to serve as content/data sources that are scrubbed to remove images, ad-copy, irrelevant links, etc., ingested by ai after being scrubbed and converted to ai-optimal formatting, and used to generate q+a pairs that are validated and scored by a secondary ai processing stage; augmented (optionally) by additional sources identified from the web and synthetic q&a pairs addressing identified knowledge-gaps, and finally prepared to be exported as json or csv formatted datasets ready to be used as ai fine-tuning datasets.
